message: "If you reference this work, please cite it as below."
title: "ADCMOplus: An Online-Learning Evolutionary Algorithm for Dynamic Constrained Multi-Objective Optimization"
abstract: >-
  An online-learning evolutionary algorithm for dynamic constrained
  multi-objective optimization. Four learned components — sentinel-based change
  detection with adaptive sampling, a magnitude-ratio change classifier, an
  order-p autoregressive Pareto-set predictor with manifold transfer, and a
  Hedge meta-policy over response arms — are bound together by formal regret and
  identifiability guarantees.
type: thesis
